_vrf_PLAT924_I
;
PROBLEM: The Reported and Calculated Rho(min) Differ by 26.06 e\%A^-3^ 
RESPONSE: Both cif and fcf files were generated during the last 
refinement. This is a refined twinned crystal structure with 
jana2006 using an hklf 5 format. This is the source of the 
discrepancies between what is contained in the cif and fcf  files. 
;
_vrf_PLAT972_I
;
PROBLEM: Large Calcd. Non-Metal Negative Residual Density -21.31 e\%A^-3^ 
RESPONSE: Both cif and fcf files were generated during the last refinement. 
This is a refined twinned crystal structure with jana2006 using an hklf 5 
format. This is the source of the discrepancies between what is contained 
in the cif and fcf  files. 
;
_vrf_PLAT974_I
;
